pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">□ </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">주의사항</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">- </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">본교 신청인원이 회차당</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">40</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">명 이상일 시 </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">구미 출발 리무진 제공</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(40</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">명 미달일 시 </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">대구 경북대 학생주차장</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">에서 출발</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">) </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">- </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">신청</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">입금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">취소</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">환불접수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">는 행사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">희망차수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">) 3</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일전까지만 접수</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">- </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">출발 당일 점심식사는 본인이 지참</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
